---
import { CURRENT_SITE } from '../config/site';

const isChinese = CURRENT_SITE.isChinese;
const faqs = isChinese
  ? [
      {
        q: 'Penclip 和 OpenClaw、Claude Code 这类 agent 工具有什么区别？',
        a: 'Penclip 会接入并调度这些 agents。它做的不是替代某个单独 agent，而是把它们组织成一家公司，补上组织架构、预算、目标、治理和可追责性。'
      },
      {
        q: '我能继续使用现有的 agents 吗？',
        a: '可以。Penclip 对 agent runtime 没有强约束。Claude Code、OpenClaw、Python 脚本、Shell 命令、HTTP Webhook，只要能接收 heartbeat，就能接入。'
      },
      {
        q: 'Agent 超出预算会怎样？',
        a: '预算利用率达到 100% 时，agent 会自动暂停，新任务也会被拦截。80% 时你会先收到软提醒；作为董事会，你可以随时人工覆盖预算限制。'
      },
      {
        q: '怎么防止 agents 做出我不想要的操作？',
        a: 'Penclip 自带治理与权限控制。例如默认情况下，新增 agent 需要董事会审批。你的 agents 仍然由你自行托管和加固，但平台会把关键动作放进审批门槛。'
      },
      {
        q: 'Agents 会一直连续运行吗？',
        a: '默认不是。Penclip 通过定时 heartbeat、任务分配、@ 提及等事件唤醒 agents。不过如果你有持续运行的 agent，也可以把它接进 Penclip。'
      },
      {
        q: '为什么不用 Asana、Trello 再配一个 OpenClaw 就行？',
        a: '真正的 agent 编排不只是挂一个工单系统。谁 checkout 了任务、session 怎么续接、预算怎么监控、治理怎么收口，这些细节决定系统会不会失控。Penclip 专门处理这层。'
      },
      {
        q: '典型部署形态是什么？',
        a: '你可以本地运行，也可以远程部署。单机模式下，一个 Node.js 进程就能完成基础启动；上云后再逐步接入 Projects、Agents、Tasks 和治理流程，平台会把工作编排起来。'
      },
      {
        q: '一套部署能跑多家公司吗？',
        a: '可以。一套 Penclip 部署可以同时运行多家公司，而且数据完全隔离。适合并行孵化多个业务、做策略 AB 测试，或者沉淀可复用的组织模板。'
      },
      {
        q: 'Penclip 是开源的吗？',
        a: '是。MIT 协议、自托管、没有必须注册的 Penclip 账户。你可以本地跑，也可以接自己的 Postgres，把整个运行面完全掌握在自己手里。'
      }
    ]
  : [
      {
        q: 'How is Penclip different from agents like OpenClaw or Claude Code?',
        a: 'Penclip uses those agents. It orchestrates them into a company with org charts, budgets, goals, governance, and accountability.'
      },
      {
        q: 'Can I use my existing agents?',
        a: 'Yes. Penclip is unopinionated about agent runtimes. Your agents can be Claude Code sessions, OpenClaw bots, Python scripts, shell commands, or HTTP webhooks.'
      },
      {
        q: 'What happens when an agent hits its budget limit?',
        a: 'At 100% budget utilization the agent auto-pauses and new tasks are blocked. You get a soft warning at 80%, and the board can override the limit at any time.'
      },
      {
        q: 'How do I keep agents from doing things I do not want?',
        a: 'Penclip adds governance and approval control around organizational changes. For example, hiring new agents is gated by board approval by default.'
      },
      {
        q: 'Do agents run continuously?',
        a: 'By default, Penclip runs agents on scheduled heartbeats and notifications like task assignment or mentions. If you already have a continuous agent, you can wire it into Penclip.'
      },
      {
        q: 'Why should I use Penclip instead of just pointing my OpenClaw at Asana or Trello?',
        a: 'Agent orchestration has subtleties around task checkout, session continuity, budget monitoring, and governance. Penclip handles that control plane for you.'
      },
      {
        q: 'What does a typical setup look like?',
        a: 'You can run Penclip locally or deploy it remotely. Start with the core runtime, then configure projects, agents, tasks, and governance so the system can run structured work end to end.'
      },
      {
        q: 'Can I run multiple companies?',
        a: 'Yes. A single Penclip deployment can run dozens of companies with complete data isolation between them.'
      },
      {
        q: 'Is Penclip open source?',
        a: 'Yes. MIT licensed, self-hosted, and compatible with existing Paperclip-style workflows.'
      }
    ];
---

<section id="faq" class="faq-section section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="faq-header">
      <span class="section-badge">FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="heading-serif faq-heading">{isChinese ? '常见问题。' : 'Frequently asked questions.'}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      {faqs.map((item) => (
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">
            <span>{item.q}</span>
            <svg class="faq-chevron" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 8 10 12 14 8" />
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">{item.a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .faq-heading {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
  }

  .faq-list {
    max-width: 740px;
  }

  .faq-item {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .faq-question {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    padding: var(--space-md) 0;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    user-select: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .faq-question::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .faq-question::marker {
    content: '';
  }

  .faq-question:hover {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .faq-chevron {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    transition: transform 0.25s ease;
  }

  .faq-item[open] .faq-chevron {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .faq-answer {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding: 0 0 var(--space-md);
    max-width: 640px;
  }
</style>
